  1064                              <1> ; draw_memline: "Base 640 KB   XMS 2048 KB   EMS 1024 KB" under the bar.
  1065                              <1> ; While POST counts: what setup configured (CMOS 15h/16h, 17h/18h);
  1066                              <1> ; at the end (ST_MISC bit 2): what POST found (40:13, INT 15h AH=88h).
  1067                              <1> ; EMS: CMOS 36h (64 KB units, at most 35h, as setup keeps it). XMS is
  1068                              <1> ; the extended memory HIMEM.SYS will offer as XMS.
  1069                              <1> ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------
