   247                              <1> 
   248                              <1> ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------
   249                              <1> ; v_screen -- the display off (AL = 0) or on (AL <> 0); all registers
   250                              <1> ; kept. VGA (INT 10h AX=1A00h answers 1Ah): sequencer register 1 bit 5
   251                              <1> ; (Screen Off; a mode set clears it). MDA / CGA: the mode control
   252                              <1> ; register (3B8h / 3D8h) bit 3 (video enable), from the BIOS's copy of
   253                              <1> ; it at 40:65. An EGA ignores 3D8h, so there the page still shows.
   254                              <1> ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------
   255                              <1> v_screen:
